  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tosimbana  -  Programme pilote de leadereship feminin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with the African Union (AU), the UK will provide technical support and establish a solidarity network for new female ministers appointed to the executive level of government. It will also extend to parliamentarians and senators, working to increase gender parity within the government and across political parties.</narrative>
  </description>
